# The build context is the **repository root** — SPEC-051. It was `MusicRoom/` until a Render deploy
# failed on `"/src": not found`: a hosting platform that resolves its Dockerfile path from the repo root
# and its build context from somewhere else is a setting to get wrong once per provider. One context,
# written in the Dockerfile's own COPY paths, is a setting nobody can get wrong.
#
# Everything the image does not need is excluded here, because a context is uploaded before it is used
# and this repository carries documentation, PDFs and a reference tree that no build reads.

# Never let a credential or build output reach an image layer — ci-cd-containerization,
# secrets-management. .env is the one that matters most.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

bin/
obj/
.git/
.github/
node_modules/
reference/
**/.DS_Store
Dockerfile
.dockerignore

# Not source, and together the largest part of the context: documentation and its generated PDFs, the
# knowledge base, the client root, load-test output and database dumps.
docs/
brain/
MusicRoomApp/
backups/
tests/load/
*.pdf
*.md
